  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alliances Caucasus 2: Regional Market Alliances for Rural Development in the SC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Alliances Caucasus 2: Regional Market Alliances for Rural Development in the SC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal on the impact level is following:

Income increased and livelihoods improved  for rural producers due to better, sustainable productivity, resilient market access, local employment opportunities and more equitable inclusion in local natural resource management and use.

Expected outcomes are as below: 

1.  Rural producers increase profitability and sustainability due to access to target services and inputs.

2. Sustainable and diversified MSMEs provide more reliable, value-added market access to rural producers.

3. Local institutions provide improved access to more equitable local decision making and agency over natural  resource use for rural producers.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let f&#xF6;r programmet &#xE4;r att &#xF6;ka inkomsterna och f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra f&#xF6;rs&#xF6;rjningsm&#xF6;jligheterna f&#xF6;r producenter p&#xE5; landsbygden med fokus p&#xE5; f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad och h&#xE5;llbar produktivitet, motst&#xE5;ndskraftig marknadstillg&#xE5;ng, lokala syssels&#xE4;ttningsm&#xF6;jligheter och j&#xE4;mlik lokal integrering.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the programme is to increase income and improve livelihoods for rural producers based on improved and sustainable productivity, resilient market access, local employment opportunities and equitable inclusion locally.</narrative>
  </description>
